{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《2026年度叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》將於明年1月1日晚，假亞洲國際博覽館ARENA舉行。商台今日（13日）公布「叱咤樂壇我最喜愛的組合」第一階段投票結果。截至今日中午12時，最後10強名單包括COLLAR、Dear Jane、ERROR、JFYT、MIRROR、Pandora、VIVA、Zpecial、晚安莉莉及農夫。12強走勢名單中的RubberBand與人夫集團在最後階段未能成功打入10強。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:36:29.181218+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:57:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T22:22:28.350881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:30:00.827637+00:00","content_hash":"58e33cbe971a9bf6cd0c1a6f9acd051dcec1bff5d96c0d9279dbfc50fb993ac8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}